#
# Every text file is checked out with LF line endings on every platform. Committed scenario
# logs, scenario files, goldens' canonical logs and other fixtures are compared byte for
# byte with what the code writes (always `\n`), so a Windows checkout with
# `core.autocrlf=true` (the GitHub Windows runners' default) must not turn them into CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary content: never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.ttf binary
